    "rulings": [
      {
        "answer": "If that inherited effect is an effect such as a [Your Turn] [All Turns] effect that increases DP upon activation after being placed in digivolution cards, you can delete 1 of your opponent's Digimon with DP less than or equal to the DP after it was increased.",
        "question": "I used this card's [End of Your Turn] effect to place a Digimon card with an inherited effect that increases DP in this Digimon’s digivolution cards. In such cases, can I use \"delete 1 of your opponent's Digimon with DP less than or equal to this Digimon's DP\" to delete 1 of my opponent's Digimon with DP less than or equal to the DP after it was increased?",
